msgstr "当前 GEM-ID"

msgid "Applied"
msgstr "已应用"

msgid "Bind one LAN port to the operator IPTV VLAN. Applying the configuration removes the selected port from br-lan."
msgstr "将一个 LAN 口绑定到运营商 IPTV VLAN。应用配置时会把所选端口移出 br-lan。"

msgid "Carries DHCP, authentication, video on demand and, when no separate multicast VLAN is set, multicast traffic."
msgstr "承载 DHCP、鉴权和点播；未设置独立组播 VLAN 时也承载组播流量。"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Grant access to PON configuration, board identity, calibration data and the IPTV bridge"
msgstr "允许访问 PON 配置、板级身份、校准数据与 IPTV 网桥"

msgid "IGMP upstream VLAN"
msgstr "IGMP 上行 VLAN"

msgid "IPTV"
msgstr "IPTV"

msgid "IPTV LAN port"
msgstr "IPTV LAN 口"

msgid "IPTV bridge"
msgstr "IPTV 网桥"

msgid "Leave the multicast VLAN empty when both services use the same VLAN."
msgstr "两种业务共用同一 VLAN 时，请将组播 VLAN 留空。"

msgid "Multicast VLAN"
msgstr "组播 VLAN"

msgid "Network device carrying the operator VLANs, normally pon0."
msgstr "承载运营商 VLAN 的网络设备，通常为 pon0。"

msgid "Optional. In separate multicast VLAN mode, IPv4 multicast flows downstream and IGMP is allowed upstream."
msgstr "可选。使用独立组播 VLAN 时，IPv4 组播向机顶盒下行，并允许 IGMP 上行。"

msgid "Optional. Leave empty to use the multicast VLAN, or the service VLAN when no separate multicast VLAN is configured."
msgstr "可选。留空时使用组播 VLAN；未设置独立组播 VLAN 时使用业务 VLAN。"

msgid "PON interfaces"
msgstr "PON 接口"

msgid "PON line stopped"
msgstr "PON 线路已停止"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

msgid "Debug mode"
msgstr "调试模式"

msgid "Debug mode continuously keeps recent raw PON, OMCI and OAM packets in RAM. The setting remains enabled after reboot."
msgstr "调试模式会在内存中持续保留最近的 PON、OMCI 和 OAM 原始包，重启后仍然生效。"

msgid "Diagnostic operations"
msgstr "诊断操作"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "网络诊断"

msgid "Download diagnostic package"
msgstr "下载诊断包"

msgid "Debug data is kept in RAM and limited to 20 MB. Applying the setting starts or stops collection."
msgstr "调试数据保存在内存中，最多占用 20 MB；应用设置后开始或停止收集。"

msgid "Enabling starts packet capture before a full PON restart. Disabling stops capture."
msgstr "开启时先启动抓包，再完整重启 PON；关闭时停止抓包。"

msgid "PON diagnostics"
msgstr "PON 诊断"

msgid "PON restart completed."
msgstr "PON 已重启。"

msgid "PON restart failed."
msgstr "PON 重启失败。"

msgid "Restart PON line"
msgstr "重启 PON 线路"

msgid "Same as multicast traffic"
msgstr "与组播流量相同"

msgid "Service VLAN"
msgstr "业务 VLAN"

msgid "The LAN port stays out of br-lan for as long as the bridge is enabled."
msgstr "网桥启用期间，该 LAN 口会保持在 br-lan 之外。"

msgid "The package contains raw packet captures, PON state, system logs and network configuration."
msgstr "诊断包包含原始抓包、PON 状态、系统日志和网络配置。"

msgid "The PON line and OMCI/OAM interfaces will be stopped and restarted. Continue?"
msgstr "PON 线路和 OMCI/OAM 接口将被停止并重新启动。是否继续？"

msgid "The selected port is dedicated to the set-top box."
msgstr "所选端口将专用于机顶盒。"

msgid "The set-top box is bridged to the operator VLANs carried by the PON uplink."
msgstr "机顶盒桥接到 PON 上联口承载的运营商 VLAN。"

